      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Major Gabriel M. gave Bartlett its name after the Civil War, and the town grew around the railroad depot that replaced the stagecoach line.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
